{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ecto Mercenary Program is a sci-fi looter shooter where you and your friends form a mercenary group to forge a path for yourselves.</strong>\u00a0Rise from a destitute crew fighting raiders for scraps to a feared force on the station. Survival is not guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your group starts extremely poor with barely enough to afford the bare necessities in staying alive. On the way up, you and your friends get to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Contracts.</strong>\u00a0Curry favor with the more powerful factions in the station. Get access to technologies that only they have, and areas they control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and maintain equipment.</strong> Equipment you have will degrade overtime. Repairing old equipment comes at the risk of permanently degrading them unless materials are provided. Weigh the risks between bringing cheap disposable crap for a mission or more expensive and powerful gear!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805240?t=1772576727","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805240/4312ec7f798fee38e43a18be72b8ea2ec3d4cc87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772576727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805240/7de204f64473beca06b92b314235aafc56f3d321/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772576727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805240/7de204f64473beca06b92b314235aafc56f3d321/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772576727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound",